    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d382-f1" n="61" xml:id="d382-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; the substance of the Deputies’ Report is recorded in the United
                    States Delegation Minutes, <hi rendition="#italic">supra.</hi></p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d382-f2" n="62" xml:id="d382-f2-content">
                <p>Annex 1 of this Record is not printed. Article 76 of the Italian Treaty, as
                    presented to and adopted by the Council at this meeting, was included in the
                    Treaty of Peace with Italy as article 87.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d382-f3" n="63" xml:id="d382-f3-content">
                <p>Under consideration at this point is CFM (46) (NY)43 (Revised), December 4, 1946,
                        <hi rendition="#italic">infra.</hi></p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d382-f4" n="64" xml:id="d382-f4-content">
                <p>The text of the redrafted article 6 is included in footnote 67, <ref
                        target="#pg1418">p. 1418</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
